T-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>干事</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>若干名，具体办法如下：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
