<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">7.<FONT face=宋体>高二团学干部招聘前提资格须是原高一的团学干事</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">/</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>班干部</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">/<FONT face=宋体>团干部/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>社团骨干等。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>二</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、招聘</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>部门</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（一）团委</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(192,192,192); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(192,192,192)"><FONT face=宋体>组织部：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>负责</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>团员发展、团组织关系转接、团费收缴、团籍档案管理等常规工作，负责课余团校、党校的组织开展工作，负责团学干部（事）、班团学生干部的考核工作。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>要求思想觉悟高、为人正派、办事严肃认真，组织能力较强，并在同学中有一定威信的同学。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(192,192,192); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(192,192,192)"><FONT face=宋体>宣传部：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>负责推广团的知识与精神，弘扬社会主义核心价值观；协助组织部开展课余团校、课余党校工作；负责校内各类学生活动的宣传物（传单、海报、资料手册、广播音像制品等）的审核；负责团学重大活动的宣传，积极开创网络宣传新途径，及时准确地向上级团组织宣传阵地上传活动材料</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>要求思想觉悟高、团员意识强、原则性强，文字表达能力好并能熟练使用各类媒体平台的同学。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
