<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>要求热情活泼、性格开朗，具备一定策划、协调能力的组织人才和多才多艺的表演人才。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
