<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>要求热情活泼、有组织策划能力、有责任心、有奉献精神的组织人才和</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>有体育特长运动人才</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(192,192,192); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(192,192,192)"><FONT face=宋体>膳管部：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>负责定期调研学校食堂的满意度测评和超市的满意度测评，征询同学意见，做好学生与食堂、超市之间的意见沟通工作，为学校的食堂管理提供相关民意依据；维护就餐秩序，不定期开展文明就餐检查。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>要求有较强沟通能力、奉献精神和服务意识的同学。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>三</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>、招聘</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>流程</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">报名：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">可由个人自主报名(须经班主任同意)，或班主任推荐或原第十七届团学联推荐</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">干部报名截止时间： 2017年9月25日13:00；干事报名截止时间：2017年9月29日13:00。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">．面试</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">团委组织审查筛选，确定</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">参加面试的同学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">名单，并由团学联</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">主席团</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">和团委相关老师</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">进行面试。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">面试时间请留意校园网上的通知。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">．试用考察</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">干事</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">面试</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">通过者有为期一个月的试用考察，在考察期内需参加校团委会组织的培训。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4<FONT face=宋体>．正式录用：试用考察期满，合格者正式录用。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">5<FONT face=宋体>．中期考核</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学年第一学期期末，团委组织部组织进行各部门中期考核，汰劣晋优</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 357pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 34.0000" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>绍兴一中团委</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 357pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 34.0000" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2017<FONT face=宋体>年9</FONT><FONT face=宋体>月</FONT></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">
